graph TD
    A[Primary Model] -->|success| B[Staleness Check]
    A -->|ModelError| F[Base-Case Forecaster]
    B -->|fresh| C[Data Completeness Check]
    B -->|stale; OldModelError| D[Fallback Model]
    C -->|complete| E[Forecast Output]
    C -->|missing data; InputError| D[Fallback Model]
    D -->|fallback ok| E
    D -->|FallbackError| F
    F --> E

    classDef primary fill:#00D9C5,stroke:#1E3A5F,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
    classDef secondary fill:#1E3A5F,stroke:#00D9C5,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef accent fill:#e6f7f5,stroke:#00D9C5,stroke-width:2px,color:#000

    class A,B,C primary
    class D,F secondary
    class E accent